ption 1",[56]="Arcane Meditation 1",[57]="Arcane Meditation 2",[58]="Arcane Meditation 3",[59]="Magic Absorption 2",[60]="Arcane Shielding 1"},notes={[10]="Improved Fireball first: a faster Fireball is more damage every fight.",[15]="Ignite adds burn damage to every Fire crit.",[20]="Pyroblast is a big opener from range; cast it first, then Fireball.",[25]="Master of Elements gives mana back on crits, so you rest less.",[30]="Critical Mass and Blast Wave: more crits, and an area attack and daze for when two mobs reach you.",[37]="Fire Power raises your Fire damage for each of your Fire effects on the target: Ignite, Pyroblast's burn and the like.",[40]="Combustion is the capstone: a crit cooldown for elites and big pulls.",[41]="The last 20 points go to Arcane: a stronger wand for finishing mobs, then Arcane Concentration's free casts and Arcane Meditation's regen while casting."}},{key="frost",spec="Frost",split="20/0/31",link="https://foreverdb.net/class/Mage/talents",talents={[10]="Improved Frostbolt 1",[11]="Improved Frostbolt 2",[12]="Improved Frostbolt 3",[13]="Improved Frostbolt 4",[14]="Improved Frostbolt 5",[15]="Ice Shards 1",[16]="Ice Shards 2",[17]="Ice Shards 3",[18]="Ice Shards 4",[19]="Ice Shards 5",[20]="Piercing Ice 1",[21]="Piercing Ice 2",[22]="Piercing Ice 3",[23]="Improved Frost Nova 1",[24]="Improved Frost Nova 2",[25]="Ice Block 1",[26]="Shatter 1",[27]="Shatter 2",[28]="Shatter 3",[29]="Permafrost 1",[30]="Cold Snap 1",[31]="Frost Channeling 1",[32]="Frost Channeling 2",[33]="Frost Channeling 3",[34]="Ice Lance 1",[35]="Winter's Chill 1",[36]="Winter's Chill 2",[37]="Winter's Chill 3",[38]="Winter's Chill 4",[39]="Winter's Chill 5",[40]="Ice Barrier 1",[41]="Wand Specialization 1",[42]="Wand Specialization 2",[43]="Arcane Focus 1",[44]="Arcane Focus 2",[45]="Arcane Focus 3",[46]="Arcane Concentration 1",[47]="Arcane Concentration 2",[48]="Arcane Concentration 3",[49]="Arcane Concentration 4",[50]="Arcane Concentration 5",[51]="Arcane Subtlety