dds damage to Backstab, Ambush and Garrote, your stealth openers.",[19]="Improved Ambush and Initiative make the opener the fight: a likely crit and extra combo points.",[27]="Serrated Blades ignores armor and is the way into Hemorrhage.",[30]="Hemorrhage is your main builder from here, with any weapon, and it adds to Rupture damage.",[35]="Quietus adds damage to Hemorrhage and Ghostly Strike on a low-health target, finishing mobs sooner.",[40]="Thousand Cuts is the capstone: Rupture ticks make your next Hemorrhage cheaper.",[41]="The last 20 points go to Combat: cheaper Sinister Strikes, a stronger Eviscerate, more hit and parry, Riposte and a stronger off-hand."}}}})

